      "note": "第二天白天：门诊继续，来了一位新的病人。",
      "patients": [
        {
          "id": "patient_zhaoqiang_d2",
          "name": "赵强",
          "age": 27,
          "recordTemplateId": "record_fever",
          "keywords": [
            {
              "id": "sore_throat",
              "label": "咽痛",
              "category": "symptom",
              "definition": "咽喉部位的疼痛，常与上呼吸道感染或用嗓过度有关。"
            },
            {
              "id": "night_shift_injury",
              "label": "夜班受伤",
              "category": "clue",
              "definition": "赵强提到自己在医院值夜班时不慎受伤，具体经过语焉不详。"
            }
          ],
          "dialogueTree": {
            "start": "greet",
            "nodes": {
              "greet": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "医生，我嗓子疼得厉害，[[sore_throat]]已经两天了。",
                "options": [
                  { "label": "是怎么引起的？", "next": "ask_cause" },
                  { "label": "先给你检查一下嗓子。", "next": "check_direct" }
                ]
              },
              "ask_cause": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "唉，说来话长，前几天[[night_shift_injury]]，之后就一直没恢复好。",
                "options": [{ "label": "好的，我先给你做个记录。", "next": "end" }]
              },
              "check_direct": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "好的，麻烦您了。",
                "options": [{ "label": "好的，我先给你做个记录。", "next": "end" }]
              },
              "end": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "谢谢医生。",
                "options": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "phase": "night",
      "note": "第二天晚上：轮到你值夜班，急诊送来一位新患者。",
      "patients": [
        {
          "id": "patient_night_duty_d2",
          "name": "无名氏（急诊）",
          "age": 40,
          "recordTemplateId": "record_headache",
          "keywords": [
            {
              "id": "emergency_bruise",
              "label": "多处淤青",
              "category": "symptom",
              "definition": "身上多处淤青，可能来自摔倒、冲突或其他意外。"
            },
            {
              "id": "night_shift_rumor_echo",
              "label": "夜班传闻的呼应",
              "category": "clue",
              "definition": "这位患者的伤情似乎和阿俊提到的夜班传闻有些吻合，令人不安。"
            }
          ],
          "dialogueTree": {
            "start": "greet",
            "nodes": {
              "greet": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "（患者情绪激动）我不知道发生了什么，身上突然多了[[emergency_bruise]]……",
                "options": [
                  { "label": "别紧张，慢慢说，你还记得什么？", "next": "ask_detail" }
                ]
              },
              "ask_detail": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "我隐约记得走廊很暗，像是撞到了什么……这和[[night_shift_rumor_echo]]是不是有关系？",
                "options": [{ "label": "先别多想，我们尽快处理伤口。", "next": "end" }]
              },
              "end": {
                "speaker": "npc",
                "text": "谢谢医生……希望只是我多想了。",
                "options": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
